{"title":"Silverhide Head","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Leatherworking Lv 50) · Monster drop: Moonfane Moth, Harpy, Moonhart, Selene, Mother Of Moths, Ogre Shaman +1 more</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Leatherworking at level 50 <span class=\"muted\">(2859 XP)</span> from 1× <a href=\"#/item/silver-hide\">Silver Hide</a>, 4× <a href=\"#/item/wool\">Wool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"moon-mother\" title=\"Selene, Mother Of Moths - dropped it in 1 of 8 looted corpses (1/8)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/7c86cf4529db3a6a02f0.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Selene, Mother Of Moths</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/8<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"moonfane-moth\" title=\"Moonfane Moth - dropped it in 2 of 348 looted corpses (1/174)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/ac436496b9298e59bc40.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Moonfane Moth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/174<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"harpy\" title=\"Harpy - dropped it in 1 of 236 looted corpses (1/236)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/678b44f534ffde7b2c53.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Harpy</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/236<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"moonhart\" title=\"Moonhart - dropped it in 1 of 692 looted corpses (1/692)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d3bc9f909e37f5929cdb.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Moonhart</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/692<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"young-red-dragon\" title=\"Young Red Dragon - dropped it in 1 of 717 looted corpses (1/717)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d3b91d3cbc801eda1dc2.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Young Red Dragon</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/717<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-shaman\" title=\"Ogre Shaman - dropped it in 1 of 1,152 looted corpses (1/1,152)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/f9a97fb7ded29e1c31d3.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Shaman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1,152<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"silverhide-head\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/leatherworking\">Leatherworking</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/silver-hide\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/33e265dd0c1eb3e33136.svg\" alt=\"\">Silver Hide</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/wool\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/e1728324d6942e9b4191.svg\" alt=\"\">Wool</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/d5250e2dda1660455a50.svg\" alt=\"Silverhide Head\"></div><h3>Silverhide Head</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Leatherworking 50</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>6 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>11/2/2026, 8:58:08 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}